  "cves": [
    "CVE-2025-61144",
    "CVE-2025-61143"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that LibTIFF did not properly handle memory when\nprocessing certain images. An attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause LibTIFF to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2025-61143)\n\nIt was discovered that LibTIFF did not properly handle memory when\nprocessing malformed TIFF directories. An attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause LibTIFF to crash, resulting in a denial of service.\n(CVE-2025-61144)",
  "id": "USN-8113-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in LibTIFF.",
